{"title":"Seaton Trail","startsAt":"2026-10-16T17:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-16T18:30:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**I’m organizing a fall hike at Seaton Trail in Pickering October 16, at 5 30 p.m.**\n\n**We’ll aim for an 8–10 km hike, taking approximately 3–4 hours at a moderate pace, with breaks to enjoy the fall colours and take pictures.**\n\n**It should be a lovely opportunity to enjoy nature, get some exercise and meet new people.**\n\n**Bring comfortable hiking shoes, water and snacks. Let me know if you’d like to join!**","venue":{"name":"Whitevale Community Centre","address":"405 Whitevale Rd, Pickering","lat":43.887436,"lng":-79.16162,"city":"Pickering"},"fee":null,"group":"Move With Intention","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/3/0/b/highres_531805355.jpeg"}